# This branch stores a build chain, not source to collaborate on. Git must
# hand back exactly the bytes it was given.
#
# Without this, a clone on Windows checks these files out with CRLF. The
# generators emit HTML from multi-line template literals, so every newline
# inside one would become CRLF in the output - and the site is currently
# pure LF, 0 CRLF. A restore would silently rewrite all 2,549 pages.
#
# Verified by cloning the branch and comparing sha256 against the working
# copy: 237 of 238 files differed on line endings alone before this.
* -text
